        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Shivaji</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 1630 CE – 1680 CE</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Born</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 19 February 1630 (scholars disagree on the date) at the hill-fort of Shivneri near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/junnar">Junnar</a>; son of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/maratha-empire">Maratha</a> general <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/shahaji-bhonsle">Shahaji Bhonsle</a> and Jijabai</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Died</span><span class="info-stat-val">around 3-5 April 1680 at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/raigad">Raigad</a> Fort, after an illness with fever and dysentery; the cause is disputed</span></div>
